    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A STUNNING DUPLEX RESIDENCE IN ONE OF CORK`S MOST CONVENIENT LOCATIONS\n\nRPM Property are delighted to present No. 29 Glenmont, Silversprings, Tivoli, Cork, T23 X322 to the property sales market.\n\nPrepare to be impressed by this exceptional and beautifully presented two bedroom duplex apartment, extending to an impressive approximately 82 sq. m., and enjoying a superb position within the exclusive and highly regarded Glenmont development.\n\nFrom the moment you enter the mature, tree lined avenue leading into this private development, there is an immediate sense of quality, tranquillity and privacy. Glenmont comprises just 36 apartments and enjoys a wonderfully convenient yet peaceful setting to the rear of the renowned Silversprings Hotel complex.\n\nNo. 29 is a bright, spacious and exceptionally well maintained home, presented in excellent condition throughout. The accommodation is generously proportioned and thoughtfully designed, with two spacious double bedrooms, including a principal bedroom with en-suite, a beautifully appointed main bathroom and an impressive open plan living, dining and kitchen space.\n\nThe heart of this wonderful home is undoubtedly the spectacular open plan living area a bright and inviting space designed for modern living. Floor to ceiling windows flood the room with natural light and open directly onto the property`s private paved patio, creating a seamless connection between indoor and outdoor living.\n\nThe modern fitted kitchen is both stylish and practical, offering an excellent range of contemporary units, integrated appliances and a dedicated dining area making it the perfect setting for both everyday living and entertaining.\n\nStep outside and discover your own private oasis. Overlooking the beautifully maintained communal green space, this tranquil outdoor area enjoys an enviable sense of privacy and is not overlooked. Whether you are enjoying a morning coffee, relaxing with a book, entertaining friends on a summer evening or simply unwinding after a busy day, this delightful space is a true extension of the home.\n\nLocation is everything, and No. 29 Glenmont certainly delivers. Situated in the highly desirable Tivoli area, the property benefits from excellent road connectivity, with convenient access to Cork City, the surrounding suburbs and the motorway network. The exceptional DISTRICT Health & Leisure Centre is located directly adjacent to the development, offering residents an incredible range of facilities including an impressive gym, swimming pool, tennis courts, café and much more.\n\nWith a B3 BER rating gas combi boiler, lift access to both levels, a recently fitted modern kitchen, generous living accommodation and a private outdoor area, this is a property that truly stands out from the crowd.\n\nWhether you are a first time buyer seeking an exceptional home, a down sizing and looking for quality and convenience, or an investor searching for a superb property in a prime Cork location, No. 29 Glenmont is an opportunity not to be missed.\n\nStylish, spacious, private and exceptionally well located this outstanding home has it all.\n\nEarly viewing is very highly recommended to fully appreciate the quality, space, location and lifestyle on offer at this truly impressive property.\n\nACCOMMODATION\nEntrance Hallway 3.494m x 2.515m\n\nA welcoming entrance hallway with carpet flooring, excellent storage and hot press.\n\nBedroom 1 5.568m x 2.535m\n\nA bright and generously proportioned double bedroom with built-in sliding wardrobes and attractive wood effect flooring.\n\nEn-Suite 1.541m x 1.849m\n\nStylishly presented en-suite with a three piece suite, shower and fully tiled finishes.\n\nBedroom 2 3.955m x 2.543m\n\nA further bright double bedroom with built-in sliding wardrobes and wood effect flooring.\n\nMain Bathroom 1.528m x 1.805m\n\nFully tiled bathroom comprising bath with overhead shower, WC and wash hand basin.\n\nStaircase\n\nCarpeted staircase leading to the impressive open plan living accommodation.\n\nOpen Plan Living Area 5.300m x 7.858m\n\nA wonderful, bright and spacious living area offering superb flexibility for modern living.\n\nLounge\n\nAn impressive open plan reception space with tiled flooring, feature fireplace and stunning floor-to-ceiling windows, opening directly onto the private patio area and allowing natural light to flood the room.\n\nKitchen/Dining Area\n\nModern fitted kitchen with a stylish range of modern units, integrated appliances and a spacious dining area, all complemented by tiled flooring.\n\nOutside\n\nThe property enjoys a delightful private paved patio area overlooking the attractive communal green space. Private and not overlooked, it provides the perfect setting for outdoor dining, evening drinks, relaxing with a book or simply enjoying the wonderful peace and tranquillity of the surroundings.\n\n\nFeatures:\nOne allocated parking space with ample guest parking\nExclusive development of just 36 apartments\nEntered through an attractive mature tree lined avenue\nDISTRICT Health & Leisure Centre directly adjacent\nGym, swimming pool, tennis courts, café and extensive leisure facilities nearby\nSuperb road links to Cork City and the motorway network\nHighly convenient and sought after Tivoli location\nNo. 29 Glenmont is more than simply an apartment it is a wonderfully spacious and stylish home offering comfort, convenience and an exceptional lifestyle in one of Cork`s most accessible locations.\n\nContact RPM Property Sole Agent to book your viewing."
      },
